# Agent/AI Configuration (local development only)
# NOTE: agent-workflow/ and .github/workflows/ are intentionally NOT ignored:
# agent-workflow/ is the shared, repo-owned coordination layer that all
# agents/models are expected to read and update (see
# docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-11-agent-workflow-design.md), and
# .github/workflows/ holds the actual CI definitions, which must be tracked
# for GitHub Actions to run at all.
.github/*
!.github/workflows/
.claude/
.agents/
.agent/
.jules/
CLAUDE.md
graphify-out/
.vscode/
memories/

